      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to find the motivation to get up and do the whole routine again every single day. if there’s no point to any of it, and we're all just heading toward the same nothingness anyway, what's the actual purpose of the struggle? it feels like we're just fighting a losing battle for no reason.",
